### Extension VS Code « REST Client » : cliquer sur « Send Request » au-dessus de chaque requête.
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Inscription (Alice) — le token est réutilisé plus bas
# @name alice
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Alice", "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### 2. Inscription (Bob)
# @name bob
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bob", "email": "bob@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### 3. Alice crée un workspace
# @name workspace
POST {{host}}/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Agence Web", "description": "Projets clients" }


### 4. Alice invite Bob
POST {{host}}/api/workspaces/{{workspace.response.body.id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bob@example.com", "role": "MEMBER" }

### 5. Alice crée un projet
# @name project
POST {{host}}/api/workspaces/{{workspace.response.body.id}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Site vitrine", "description": "Refonte du site" }

### 6. Alice crée une tâche assignée à Bob (e-mail visible sur http://localhost:8025)
# @name task
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{project.response.body.id}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Maquette de la page d'accueil",
  "description": "Version mobile et desktop",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01",
  "assigneeEmail": "bob@example.com"
}

### 7. Bob voit ses tâches
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{bob.response.body.token}}

### 8. Bob passe la tâche en cours
PATCH {{host}}/api/tasks/{{task.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{bob.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "IN_PROGRESS" }

### 9. Bob commente (Alice reçoit un e-mail)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/{{task.response.body.id}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{bob.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Première version prête, j'attends vos retours." }

### 10. Liste filtrée des tâches du projet
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{project.response.body.id}}/tasks?status=IN_PROGRESS&priority=HIGH
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.token}}

### 11. Bob essaie de créer un projet → 403
POST {{host}}/api/workspaces/{{workspace.response.body.id}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{bob.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Interdit" }
